urāṅga’ bolite habe"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["‘gaurāṅga’ balite habe pulaka śarīra","‘hari hari’ balite nayane va’be nīra"],"translation":["When will the hairs on my body stand on end as I chant “Gaurāṅga!”? When will tears pour from my eyes as I chant, “Hari! Hari!”?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["āra kabe nitāichā̐da karuṇā karibe","saṁsāra-vāsanā more kabe tuchchha ha’be"],"translation":["When will Nītāichā̐d be merciful to me? When will my worldly desires become insignificant?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["viṣaya chhāḍiyā kabe śuddha ha’be mana","kabe hāma heraba śrī-vṛndāvana"],"translation":["When will my mind give up all worldliness and become pure? When will I behold Śrī Vṛndāvan?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["rūpa-raghunātha-pade ha-ibe ākuti","kabe hāma bujhaba se yugala-pīriti"],"translation":["When will I long for Śrī Rūpa and Śrī Raghunāth’s feet? When will I understand the Divine Couple’s love?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["rūpa-raghunātha-pade rahu mora āśa","prārthanā karaye sadā narottama dāsa"],"translation":["“May my aspiration be at the feet of Śrī Rūpa and Śrī pkobe-hobe-bolo-se-dina-amarRaghunāth.” Narottam Dās always prays in this way."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gauranga-bolite-hobe","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-gauranga-bolite","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Gaurāṅga-bolite-habe-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/gauranga-bolite-hobe-pulaka-shorira/","description":"‘Gaurāṅga’ bolite habe — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.",